==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Literally “for what”, from {{m|sh|za||for}} + {{m|sh|štȍ||what}}. For the conjunction compare {{m|sh|zato što}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/zâʃto/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|za|što|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=zȁšto}}

# [[why]], [[what for]]
#: ''zašto (da) ne?'' — why not?
#: ''zašto to?'' — why so? why is that?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|why}} {{l|sh|štȍ}}

===Conjunction===
{{sh-conjunction|head=zȁšto}}

# {{lb|sh|archaic}} [[because]]

====Synonyms====
* (''Croatia'') {{l|sh|zakaj}}, {{l|sh|zač}}
* {{l|sh|zàtō}}

